s:**\n\n*   **Question 1:** What is the movie genre of the person who drinks mirinda?\n    *   The person who drinks mirinda is at Position 2.\n    *   The movie genre at Position 2 is **superhero**.\n\n*   **Question 2:** At what position is the person who drinks mirinda?\n    *   The person who drinks mirinda is at Position **2**.\n\n*   **Question 3:** What movie genre does the person who listens to classical watch?\n    *   The person who listens to classical is at Position 1.\n    *   The movie genre at Position 1 is **spy**.\n\n*   **Question 4:** What music genre does the person who drinks cola listen to?\n    *   The person who drinks cola is at Position 1.\n    *   The music genre at Position 1 is **classical**.\n\n**5. Final Formatting:**\nThe answers in order are: superhero, 2, spy, classical.\n\nFinal answer: <solution>superhero, 2, spy, classical</solution>", "logprobs": [{"token": "Let", "logprob": -0.042369395}, {"token": "'s", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " break", "logprob": -0.047103107}, {"token": " down", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " the", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " problem", "logprob": -3.9511387}, {"token": " step", "logprob": -2.6703237e-05}, {"token": " by", "logprob": -6.3181124e-06}, {"token": " step", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": ".", "logprob": -1.7208515}, {"token": "\n\n", "logprob": -0.0005531052}, {"token": "**", "logprob": -0.00015879938}, {"token": "1", "logprob": -0.0010271578}, {"token": ".", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " Define", "logprob": -0.7003779}, {"token": " the", "logprob": -1.192093e-07}, {"token": " Setup", "logprob": -0.36534843}, {"token": ":**", "logprob": -0.53046733}, {"token": "\n", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "*", "logprob": -1.3334856}, {"token": "  ", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " There", "logprob": -0.048929546}, {"token": " are", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " ", "logprob": -0.00013268874}, {"token": "2", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " positions", "logprob": -0.011447314}, {"token": ":", "logprob": -0.002756039}, {"to